---
description: Never use void to discard promises or fire-and-forget calls
alwaysApply: true
---

# No `void` for promises

Never prefix promise/async calls with `void` to silence floating-promise lint or discard the result.

```tsx
// BAD
onRetry={() => void query.refetch()}
onClick={() => void addSet()}
void navigate({ to: "/" });

// GOOD
onRetry={() => query.refetch()}
onClick={() => addSet()}
navigate({ to: "/" });
```

Call the promise/function directly. Do not add `void` «для префикса» в колбэках и эффектах.
